//MCQ

::Dataset Definition::
What is a Dataset in Spark?
{
    ~ A file format used to store data
    = A strongly typed distributed collection of domain-specific objects
    ~ A replacement for SparkSession
    ~ A local collection stored on the driver
}

::Dataset vs DataFrame::
Which statement correctly describes a Dataset?
{
    ~ It is only available in Python
    = It combines the benefits of RDDs (type safety) and DataFrame optimization
    ~ It does not support functional transformations
    ~ It cannot be converted to a DataFrame
}

::Dataset Operations::
Which of the following operations can be applied to a Dataset?
{
    = map(), filter(), flatMap()
    ~ Only SQL queries
    ~ Only shuffle operations
    ~ Only aggregation functions
}
